WEBVTT

00:00:00.540 --> 00:00:01.070
Hello!

00:00:01.191 --> 00:00:04.670
Services and prices are the first thing customers look at when they book.

00:00:05.019 --> 00:00:08.110
In this lesson, I'll show you how to add a service to your salon:

00:00:08.299 --> 00:00:12.270
its name, how long it takes, the price, and who performs it.

00:00:12.619 --> 00:00:15.150
Customers see exactly that when they book online.

00:00:15.749 --> 00:00:18.359
In your dashboard, tap Services in the menu.

00:00:18.608 --> 00:00:22.359
Here is your salon's whole service menu, with prices and durations.

00:00:22.783 --> 00:00:25.079
To add a new one, tap Add service.

00:00:25.682 --> 00:00:26.772
A form opens.

00:00:26.880 --> 00:00:31.252
Under Basics, enter the Service name, for example, French manicure.

00:00:31.608 --> 00:00:34.532
Choose a Service group, if you sort your menu into groups.

00:00:34.919 --> 00:00:36.212
And write a short Description:

00:00:36.467 --> 00:00:39.332
it appears right under the service name when a customer picks it.

00:00:39.924 --> 00:00:41.654
Next, Time and price.

00:00:41.763 --> 00:00:46.694
Tap a Duration, for example forty-five minutes, or type any number of minutes.

00:00:46.973 --> 00:00:50.054
Cleanup time after is the break between two customers.

00:00:50.323 --> 00:00:52.694
Choose the Currency, then enter the Price.

00:00:52.963 --> 00:00:56.294
If you want customers to pay a deposit, fill in Deposit too.

00:00:56.640 --> 00:00:59.894
The golden line below shows exactly what customers will see.

00:01:00.410 --> 00:01:01.900
Then, Who performs it.

00:01:02.195 --> 00:01:06.060
Tap the staff members who can do this service, or tap Select all.

00:01:06.308 --> 00:01:08.300
When you're done, tap Save at the bottom.

00:01:08.846 --> 00:01:11.197
The new service appears in the list straight away.

00:01:11.543 --> 00:01:13.197
Each service has its buttons:

00:01:13.298 --> 00:01:17.810
Edit, Duplicate to quickly create a similar one, Add-ons to attach extras,

00:01:17.760 --> 00:01:19.437
and Hide when you pause it.

00:01:19.892 --> 00:01:22.557
You can also drag the handle on the left to change the order.

00:01:22.906 --> 00:01:24.237
Now take the quiz below.
